    "description": "What: on berlin a PHYSICAL 'Blue Platoon' (PlatoonDefend at (300,300), threat north) commands ONE STOCHASTIC 'Blue Stochastic Squad'; a PHYSICAL 'Red Squad' stands 480 m north. Judge (X-2, X2-H): (1) the platoon orders the squad Defend by kind (the generic StochasticUnitDefend); (2) the squad splits and within 3 s runs SquadDefend - the platoon's SAME order (its request id kept), so the platoon does not re-send it and the posted men are not restarted. Fail: the squad back on the stochastic play, or a second order after the switch. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-commanded-split"
